# private — going-forward rule for edge-sensitive doc surfaces
# (existing tracked files in public history retain their tracking; only
# new files matching these patterns auto-stay-private. backups land in
# workspace plans/ via the standard /sync-workspace skill.)
# *_AUDIT.md             — optimization audits, latency findings, etc.
# FUTURE_*.md            — roadmap / planned-strategy direction
# *-design-notes.md      — versioned design idea backlogs
# *-suggestions.md       — HFT / optimization research outputs
# *-hft-*.md             — HFT-flavored notes
# *-OPTIMIZATION-*.md    — surgical optimization references
# *-plan-check.md        — agent-generated plan-check reports
# STRATEGY_AND_CODING_RULES.md — Gemini-distilled coding invariants
# GEMINI.md              — Gemini agent's project memory file (analog of CLAUDE.local.md)
*_AUDIT.md
FUTURE_*.md
*-design-notes.md
*-suggestions.md
*-hft-*.md
*-OPTIMIZATION-*.md
*-plan-check.md
STRATEGY_AND_CODING_RULES.md
GEMINI.md
GEMINI.local.md

# local Claude Code memory overlays (private — auto-loaded alongside CLAUDE.md)
CLAUDE.local.md
*.local.md

# v5.11.43 — DOCS privacy migration. Architectural / operator-edge docs now
# live in workspace/DOCS/ (private). Engine-repo DOCS/ has symlinks pointing
# at the workspace; gitignore them to silence "untracked" noise. Only
# operator setup/usage docs stay tracked: QUICKSTART, OPERATOR_DEPLOYMENT,
# CONFIGURATION, ML_USAGE, ML_TRAINING, CONTRIBUTING, LATENCY_PROFILING.
# Public engine repo cloned without workspace gets DOCS/ with only those 7.
DOCS/CLAUDE_*.md
# DOCS/CHANGELOG.md and DOCS/changelogs/ are PUBLIC — see workspace privacy boundary
